## 2. External call graph

The oodac/ files that import from std/hw/arch_aarch64/ are exactly one: `oodac/aarch64_emit_elf.oo:13` imports `std/hw/arch_aarch64/aarch64_codegen.oo`. The `cli_build_sovereign.oo:15` chain reaches std via `aarch64_emit_elf.oo`. All other oodac/ files stop at the aarch64_emit ladder (`aarch64_emit.oo`, `aarch64_emit_harv.oo`, `aarch64_emit_cond.oo`, `aarch64_emit_take.oo`, `aarch64_emit_if.oo`, `aarch64_emit_sys.oo`, `aarch64_emit_fold.oo`, `aarch64_emit_num.oo`, `aarch64_emit_secret.oo`, `aarch64_emit_diag.oo`, `aarch64_emit_secret.oo`, `aarch64_main.oo`) and call nothing from std/hw/arch_aarch64/.

Each std fn with at least one external caller (file:line). "External" excludes files inside `std/hw/arch_aarch64/`.

